@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - User

[*] --> UserType

state UserType <<choice>>

UserType --> CitizenLogin : [Citizen user]
UserType --> RegistrarLogin : [Registrar user]

state "Citizen Login" as CitizenLogin
CitizenLogin : entry / Action needed
CitizenLogin : do / enter login credentials
CitizenLogin : exit / Entered into system

state "Registrar Login" as RegistrarLogin
RegistrarLogin : entry / Action needed
RegistrarLogin : do / enter login credentials
RegistrarLogin : exit / Entered into system

state CitizenRegister : [Citizen user not registered]
CitizenLogin --> CitizenRegister
CitizenRegister --> RegisteredCitizen : register as citizen

state RegistrarRequest : [Registrar user requesting certificate]
RegistrarLogin --> RegistrarRequest
RegistrarRequest --> RequestSent : send request for certificate

state RegisteredCitizen
RegisteredCitizen : entry / Citizen logged in
RegisteredCitizen : do / view profile, upload documents, apply for certificates
RegisteredCitizen : exit / Logged out

state "Uploading Documents" as UploadDocs
UploadDocs : entry / User wants to upload more documents
UploadDocs : do / upload additional documents
UploadDocs : exit / Done uploading

state "Applying for Certificate" as ApplyCert
ApplyCert : entry / User wants to apply for a certificate
ApplyCert : do / apply for certificate
ApplyCert : exit / Application sent

state "Request Sent" as RequestSent
RegistrarRequest --> RequestSent
RequestSent : entry / Request received by issuer
RequestSent : do / verify and issue certificate
RequestSent --> CertificateIssued : [Certificate issued]
RequestSent --> Rejected : [Certificate rejected]

state "Certificate Issued" as CertificateIssued
CertificateIssued : entry / Certificate issued to citizen
CertificateIssued : do / update citizen's profile
CertificateIssued : exit / Done

state "Rejected" as Rejected
Rejected : entry / Certificate rejected by issuer
Rejected : do / notify citizen and registrar
Rejected --> RequestSent : [Registrar re-requests certificate]

state LoggedOut
RegisteredCitizen --> LoggedOut : log out
UploadDocs --> LoggedOut : log out
ApplyCert --> LoggedOut : log out
CertificateIssued --> LoggedOut : log out
Rejected --> LoggedOut : log out
RequestSent --> LoggedOut : log out

@enduml
